    notes:
    - pageIndex: 0
      title: "Numune g\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFC"
      explanation: "Numuneler ayn\u0131 \xF6zelli\u011Fi de\u011Fi\u015Ftiriyorsa,
        daha sonra kar\u015F\u0131la\u015F\u0131lan numunenin izi son kay\u0131tta
        belirginle\u015Fir. Her i\u015Flemin zaman, bi\xE7im ve g\xFC\xE7 \xFCzerindeki
        etkisini ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 g\xF6zle."
      blocks: []
    - pageIndex: 0
      title: "Deney masas\u0131 notu"
      explanation: "Birden fazla tepki \xFCreten numune de normal bir hat \xFCzerinde
        \xE7al\u0131\u015Fabilir. Tepki say\u0131s\u0131yla hat say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131
        ayn\u0131 \u015Fey sanma."
